{"version":1,"content":"<p>46歲日本女星廣末涼子發生超速駕駛肇事及傷人事件後，被診斷患上躁鬱症與甲狀腺機能亢進停工近一年，直至今年4月才復出藝能界。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;廣末出道以來在亞洲知名度高企，上月中，她與子女同住的寓所卻遭一名亞裔男狂迷</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.365437+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:03:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558559+00:00","content_hash":"b63bbbcf0ef25e084250efe245ae08f6959bfd4a27fb37a7afa3c6b2eeedff77","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}